summary.label:
Make transfers from KiwiTaxi using mobile application.
To start working with the application you need to get a login and password from your dispatcher.
The following functions are available in the application:
- viewing full information about the order;
- contacting the client;
- changing order status;
- viewing the history of completed orders;
- a section with useful articles on working at KiwiTaxi
The application requires an Internet connection and permission to send driver geolocation data.
